    "blurb": "Five years of concerts and shows in order: Maroon 5, Coldplay and Måneskin, four nights at the Kia Forum, Taylor Swift's Eras Tour opening night in LA, a Genshin Impact symphony, Lang Lang playing Beethoven, and Bruno Mars twice."
  },
  {
    "href": "/misc/3d-printing",
    "title": "Layer by Layer",
    "group": "collections",
    "when": "2 printers · 2021–26",
    "where": "The lab at USC, then home",
    "tags": [
      "collections"
    ],
    "img": "/misc/3d-printing/liberty.jpg",
    "blurb": "Five years of 3D printing: Stanford's Lucy and a Bing Dwen Dwen that went from print to mould to paint on the lab's Ultimaker, then my own Bambu Lab P1S and a sideboard of landmarks, from Pisa to a rainbow Burj Khalifa."
  },
  {
    "href": "/misc/hawaii-2026",
    "title": "A Sky on Fire, Then Waikīkī",
    "group": "2026",
    "when": "Sep",
    "where": "Big Island & Oʻahu",
    "tags": [],
    "img": "/misc/hawaii-2026/kilauea-glow.jpg",
    "blurb": "Kīlauea erupting under a blood-red night sky on our first evening, then Hilo, a Kona coffee farm and a week on Oʻahu, from Waikīkī and Pearl Harbor to Byodo-In and Kualoa."
  },
  {
    "href": "/misc/tahoe-2026",
    "title": "Two Capitols and a Very Clear Lake",
    "group": "2026",
    "when": "Aug",
    "where": "Lake Tahoe & the coast",
    "tags": [
      "wangcai"
    ],
    "img": "/misc/tahoe-2026/wangcai-tour-boat.jpg",
    "blurb": "A relaxed five-day loop at the end of summer: Sacramento's Capitol and Tower Bridge, Wangcai on a pedal boat on Lake Tahoe, Carson City and Reno, Emerald Bay and the ruined tea house on Fannette Island, then Santa Cruz and Carmel."
  },
  {
    "href": "/misc/july4-2026",
    "title": "Fireworks for the 250th",
    "group": "2026",
    "when": "Jul",
    "where": "Philadelphia, D.C., Baltimore",
    "tags": [
      "holidays"
    ],
