    "blurb": "Four days of spring break in the car: sunset among the hoodoos of the Bisti badlands, a town of tire-and-bottle houses near Taos, an empty Red Rocks Amphitheatre, and the Bellagio's spring garden. Wangcai rolled in the dirt."
  },
  {
    "href": "/misc/sedona-2026",
    "title": "Red Rocks, a Pink Jeep and Teal Arches",
    "group": "2026",
    "when": "Jan–Feb",
