    "tags": [
      "wangcai"
    ],
    "img": "/misc/sedona-2026/moonrise.jpg",
    "blurb": "A Pink Jeep up the Broken Arrow route to Chicken Point, a nearly full moon rising over glowing red rocks at golden hour, and Wangcai under the world's only teal McDonald's arches."
  },
  {
    "href": "/misc/oregon-2025",
    "title": "Thanksgiving, the Long Way Round",
    "group": "2025",
    "when": "Nov",
