    "blurb": "Four days on the Big Island: Kona, Hilo and the lava coast, then one long Saturday from the ancient Kalahuipuaʻa fishponds to the floor of Kīlauea Iki, a sunset above the clouds on Mauna Kea, and the Milky Way."
  },
  {
    "href": "/misc/siggraph-2025",
    "title": "Rods in Vancouver",
