    "blurb": "A short weekend at Big Bear Lake: the Rim of the World Highway at golden hour, cat-themed mochas, stars through the pines and a Sunday morning at Lake Arrowhead, with Wangcai on dawn watch at the window."
  },
  {
    "href": "/misc/wangcai-2025",
    "title": "Bringing Wangcai Home",
    "group": "2025",
    "when": "Jan",
    "where": "Boston, Portsmouth, Portland",
    "tags": [
      "wangcai"
    ],
    "img": "/misc/wangcai-2025/portland-pier-buoys.jpg",
    "blurb": "A snowy long weekend after the SIGGRAPH deadline: Boston by night, Portsmouth's white steeple, Portland's harbor at sunset, and the trip that brought a shelter dog called Muffin home to LA as Wangcai."
  },
  {
    "href": "/misc/roadtrip-2024",
    "title": "The Hedgehog Who Went to Key West",
    "group": "2024",
    "when": "Jul–Aug",
    "where": "SIGGRAPH Denver → Key West",
    "tags": [
      "siggraph"
    ],
    "img": "/misc/roadtrip-2024/niagara-falls.jpg",
    "blurb": "SIGGRAPH 2024 in Denver, then a flight to New York and two weeks and 2,541 miles through New England, the Great Lakes and Chicago, a hop to Florida, and down the Overseas Highway to Key West. A toy hedgehog, bought at a Vermont rest stop, was the mascot throughout."
  },
  {
    "href": "/misc/springfield-2024",
    "title": "Welcome to Springfield (the Real One)",
    "group": "2024",
    "when": "May",
    "where": "Springfield, OR",
    "tags": [],
    "img": "/misc/springfield-2024/homer-couch.jpg",
