    "title": "Two Road Trips on a Brand-New License",
    "group": "2022",
    "when": "May",
    "where": "Bay Area & Yellowstone",
    "tags": [],
    "img": "/misc/roadtrips-2022/canyon-snow-pines.jpg",
    "blurb": "A new driver's license and two road trips in one month: a loop through Berkeley, San Francisco, Stanford and Silicon Valley and home down Highway 1, then a Memorial Day snowstorm in Yellowstone and the Tetons."
  },
  {
