    "when": "Mar",
    "where": "Death Valley, Vegas, Page",
    "tags": [],
    "img": "/misc/desert-2022/horseshoe-bend.jpg",
    "blurb": "Five days in March, from the salt flats of Death Valley to sunrise at Horseshoe Bend and the light beams of Upper Antelope Canyon, while the phone's clock kept switching between Arizona and Navajo time."
